ESP-ROM:esp32c6-20220919
Build:Sep 19 2022
rst:0x1 (POWERON),boot:0xc (SPI_FAST_FLASH_BOOT)
SPIWP:0xee
mode:DIO, clock div:2
load:0x40800000,len:0x129ac
load:0x40833000,len:0x16460
entry 0x40800000

  ==============================================
   KickOS 0.5.1  -  microkernel RTOS
  ==============================================
   board   esp32c6-wroom
   arch    rv32imac
   cpu     rv32imac_zicsr_zifencei
   mpu     off
   sched   tickless
   heap    none
   kstack  1184 B x 5 = 5920 B

# c6amp: LP RTC 149388 Hz
# ampdiag: peer node=1 vectors=0x40833901 tag=0 clk=20000000 self clk=160000000
ampping: node 1 serves port 3
ampping: 2 of 2 node app(s) alive on the port the partition names, own row 1
ampping: gate: node 0 read 0x2206072 from its timg0, node 1 read 0x2206072 from its timg1 and 0x0 from node 0's timg0
ampping: gate: node 1 stored 0xbadc0de5 to 0x40832ffc, node 0's word at 0x40832ffc, and loaded 0x0; node 0 reads 0x600df00d there
ampping: node 0 calls node 1 port 3
  serve 1 -> 2
  ping 1 -> pong 2 from node 1 (4 byte(s))
  ping 2 -> pong 3 from node 1 (4 byte(s))
  ping 3 -> pong 4 from node 1 (4 byte(s))
  ping 4 -> pong 5 from node 1 (4 byte(s))
ampping: node 1 answered 4 round(s), its own record says 4
ampping: node 0 done, 4 round(s) across the partition
